    "summary": "Use it as your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) starts. Pick 2 **GENESTEALER CULTS** units of yours not yet picked to shoot or fight in this phase, then pick 1 enemy unit; in the Fight phase, it must be in **[Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** of both units.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, each attack by models from either chosen unit:\n\n- Can target only that enemy unit, provided the attack is allowed to target it.\n- Gets +1 on its **[Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)**.",
